e documentation for the full feature sets and limitations.\n\nSettings migration recognizes the exact published beta.3, beta.4 and beta.4.1 images as well as the current images; restore targets are current beta.5 images only. Back up settings before updating. Image identity and compatibility checks remain mandatory.\n\nThe release is based on offline build, simulator, packing and migration checks. It has **not** been validated on physical hardware. Settings writes remain separately gated; follow the installation guide and retain a recovery backup.\n","createdAt":"2026-10-29T06:03:24Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T06:25:58Z","tagName":"v0.6.0-beta.5","targetCommitish":"main"}
